        "cliente": "client",
        "pregunta": "asks — he/she form of preguntar"
      },
      "image": "images/cliente.webp",
      "note": {
        "en": "Preguntar means to ask a question. Pregunta means he or she asks. The noun la pregunta (the question) looks the same.",
        "es": "Preguntar significa \"to ask a question\". Pregunta es él o ella. El sustantivo la pregunta se escribe igual."
      }
